  "description": "Check workplace safety knowledge after training: fire, PPE, lifting, ladders, SDS, lockout/tagout and incident reporting.",
  "category": "Quizzes",
  "seoTitle": "Free Safety Training Quiz Template (Auto-Graded)",
  "seoDescription": "Safety training quiz template with ten auto-graded questions on fire safety, PPE, lifting, ladders, SDS, lockout/tagout and reporting. Keep a record per worker.",
